  "ruleText": "Liq 1105.01 Direct Shipper Package Mark. Each shipment of alcohol into New Hampshire from a direct shipper shall be clearly marked as “Alcoholic Beverages Adult Signature Required.”\n\nSource. #6837, Interim, eff 9-1-98, EXPIRED: 12-30-98\n\nNew. #6924, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRED: 1-1-07\n\nNew. #9441-A, eff 6-9-11; ss by #12968, eff 1-3-20",
